程）。学分不足部分可在全校所有本科生课程中任意选修。完成学程修读要求的学生可获得相应的微专业（学程）证书。        \n微专业（学程）课程详见教务处微专业（学程）项目网页，下载地址：https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/ （复旦大学教务处）专业培养-常用文档。        \n30 credits are required. Two independent course packages offered by other majors are required, with the option of a major program or a cross-disciplinary program. Any shortfall in credits is to be taken from all undergraduate programs in FDU. A corresponding course package certificate is awarded to those who meet the requirements.         \nFor details on the curriculum of the Cross Disciplinary Track, please refer to the academic website https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/.","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"5","rawId":"5","parent":null,"level":"1.1.1","title":"创新创业路径","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":0.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"30","requireAny":true,"requireAll":false},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"要求修读 30 学分。要求修读 1 个非本专业独立开设的微专业（学程）和 1 个创新创业学院开设的创新创业微专业（学程），学分不足部分可在全校所有本科生课程中任意选修。\n创新创业微专业（学程）课程详见教务处网页，下载地址：https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/ （复旦大学教务处）专业培养-常用文档。\n30 credits are required. One independent course package offered by another major and one-course package in innovation and entrepreneurship offered by the Innovation and Entrepreneurship Institute are required, with any shortfall in credits to be taken from all undergraduate programs. \nFor the courses of the innovation and entrepreneurship programs, please refer to the academic website https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/.","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"21","rawId":"21","parent":null,"level":"1.1.1","title":"辅修学士学位路径","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":0.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"35","requireAny":true,"requireAll":false},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"要求至少修读本专业进阶课程模块15学分和1个外院系开设的辅修学士学位项目。完成辅修学士学位项目修读要求，且达到学校毕业和学位授予要求的学生可获得相应的辅修学士学位证书。\n辅修学士学位项目课程设置详见教务处网页，下载地址：https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/ （复旦大学教务处）专业培养-常用文档。\nA minimum of 15 credits from M1 in GBF and a minor in a bachelor degree program offered by an external school are required. A corresponding minor bachelor's degree certificate is awarded to those who meet the requirements of the program and the university's graduation and degree award requirements. \nFor details on the curriculum of the Minor degree, please refer to the academic website https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/.","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"-100","rawId":"-100","parent":null,"level":"1.1.1","title":"其他","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":0.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"0","requireAny":true,"requireAll":false},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"多元发展路径中，辅修学士学位项目或专业进阶课程模块均可以冲抵学程，专业培养和多元发展路径共享的课程只计算一次学分。\nIn the Multi-Development Tracks, either the Minor Degree program or the Regular Major Modules can be offset against the program. Courses shared across the Regular Major Track and Multi-Development Tracks are only counted for credit once.","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"2~22","rawId":"2","parent":null,"level":"1.1","title":"融合创新能力","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":7.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"7","requireAny":true,"requireAll":false},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[{"code":"1061","name":"前沿讲座","credits":0.0,"required":true,"term":null,"rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"101","name":"无学分讨论班","credits":0.0,"required":true,"term":null,"rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"102","name":"复芏计划(FDUROP)","credits":0.0,"required":false,"term":null,"rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"STAT30006","name":"科研实践","credits":3.0,"required":true,"term":"3,4,5,6","rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"STAT40004","name":"生产实习","credits":1.0,"required":true,"term":"7","rule":{"requiredCourse":false,"integrationCompulsory":false,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"STAT40003","name":"毕业论文","credits":3.0,"required":true,"term":"8","rule":{"requiredCourse":false,"integrationCompulsory":false,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}}]}],"rowCount":36,"completeModules":true,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-31T16:43:46Z","programNotes":[{"title":"学科专业简介","text":"“数据科学与大数据技术”全英文项目，致力于培养具有全球竞争力的复合型人才。项目以国际化课程设置、跨文化学术交流为特色，使学生掌握数据科学前沿技术的同时，具备在多元文化环境中协同创新的能力。项目聚焦计算数学、统计学、计算机科学与行业应用的交叉融合，鼓励学生参与国际科研合作与产业实践，旨在造就一批精通专业技术、具有跨学科创新能力和国际视野的复合型大数据人才。\nThe program is dedicated to cultivating globally competitive composite talents through all-English lectures. The program features an international curriculum and cross-cultural academic exchanges, enabling students to master cutting-edge technologies in data science and at the same time have the ability to collaborate and innovate in a multicultural environment. The program focuses on the cross-fertilization of computational mathematics, statistics, computer science and industrial applications, and encourages students to participate in international scientific research cooperation and industrial practice, aiming to create a group of composite big data talents who are proficient in professional technology, have interdisciplinary innovation ability and international vision."},{"title":"培养目标","text":"本专业培养德智体美劳全面发展，具有良好的政治素质与道德修养，能够利用数据建模、分析与处理、统计推断的基本理论、方法和技能，从事大数据有关教学、科研、开发和应用的“复合型”人才。This program cultivates “composite” talents with all-round development in morality, intelligence, physicality,&nbsp; and aesthetics, good political quality and moral cultivation, who are able to engage in the teaching, scientific research, development and application of big data by using the basic theories, methods and skills of data modeling, analysis and processing, and statistical inference."},{"title":"基本要求","text":"本专业要求学生掌握大数据相关的统计、计算机、数学和应用学科的基础知识，以及数据分析、技术开发和应用的基本技能。通过系统学习专业课程，培养既有严格的专业技术训练，又有深刻数据视野的数据科学人才和数据技术人才，满足大数据相关产业对基础人才的需求。This program requires students to master the basic knowledge of statistics, computer, mathematics and applied disciplines related to big data, as well as the basic skills of data analysis, technology development and application. Through systematic study of specialized courses, the program aims to cultivate data science talents and data technology talents who have both strict professional and technical training and profound data vision, and to meet the demand for basic talents in big data-related industries."},{"title":"修业要求","text":"\n\n\n\n1.修业年限：4 年（类型：■本科、□本硕、□本博）2.学位授予说明：\n\n\n\n\n授予学位\n\n\n专业名称\n\n\n学位类型\n\n\n学段审核要求\n\n\n\n\n理学学士\n\n\n数据科学与大数据技术\n\n\n/\n\n\n□ 按照不少于总学分比例____%\n\n\n\n\n■ 按照不少于学分数 117\n\n\n\n\n■ 必修课组须通过\n\n\n通识教育课程 14 学分\n\n\n\n\n专业培养课程 66 学分\n\n\n\n\n专业进阶模块 30 学分\n\n\n\n\n融合创新能力模块 7 学分\n\n\n\n\n□其他____________________\n\n\n\n"},{"title":"学分要求","text":"专业进阶路径（117 学分）Regular Major Track (117 Credits)本路径学生需要完成 117 学分，包括通识教育课程 14 学分、专业培养课程 66 学分、专业进阶模块 30 学分、融合创新能力模块 7 学分。Students in this program are required to complete a total of 117 credits. The credit distribution consists of 14 general education credits, 66 core professional training credits, 30 advanced specialization module credits, and 7 integrated innovation capability module credits."},{"title":"学位要求","text":"本科学位Bachelor's Degree1. 4 年级结束时，如达到学士学位要求者授予理学学士学位。1. Students who meet the following requirements by the end of their fourth year will be awarded a Bachelor of Science degree.（1）修满规定的学分，达到本科教学培养方案规定的各项要求。（1）Completion of all required credits and fulfillment of all stipulations specified in the undergraduate program curriculum;（2）以符合学生毕业时所在专业教学培养方案规定的所有课程的有效成绩为准计算平均绩点，且此平均绩点大于或等于2.0。（2）Achievement of a minimum cumulative GPA of 2.0 or above, calculated based on all valid course grades as stipulated by the program curriculum in effect at the time of graduation."},{"title":"课程体系与科研训练体系","text":""}]}